1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,700
 and troubles of the world.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:03,940
 Once, even as a mission leader,

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,140
 I received a new missionary.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,400
 In our welcome interview,

5
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,440
 this young missionary began to cry

6
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,900
 and asked to be sent home.

7
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,720
 When I asked why,

8
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,800
 he couldn't find the right word to explain.

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,300
 Then I asked him,

10
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,600
 if he had the testimony of the Book of Mormon,

11
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:26,360
 he said, President, I don't.

12
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,420
 I bought my testimony of the Book of Mormon

13
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:34,720
 I then encouraged him to begin to study the scriptures, especially the book of Mormon.

14
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:40,520
 He and his trainer made a scripture study plan letter.

15
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:51,020
 I received a letter from this missionary testifying of how the early scripture study had helped him understand his purpose as a missionary.

16
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:57,220
 He said, and I quote, I am happy now and do not want to be sent home any longer.

17
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:02,440
 My friends, I invite you to start the scriptural diligence

